    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "The WebShop environment <strong>consists of a search page, results page, item page, and item-detail page</strong>. Agents can <strong>search for products using text queries</strong> and <strong>choose text buttons to navigate through the website</strong>. The environment <strong>uses a deterministic search engine</strong> to retrieve products based on the search query, and <strong>provides a reward function</strong> to evaluate the agent's performance.",
