    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "The authors <strong>trained and evaluated several agents</strong> using reinforcement learning and imitation learning. The <strong>best agent achieved a task success rate of 29%</strong>, outperforming rule-based heuristics but still lower than human expert performance. The authors also <strong>analyzed agent and human trajectories</strong> to identify areas for improvement.",
